1
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,039
I wasn't going to cause trouble

2
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,079
I was going to save someone

3
00:00:44,079 --> 00:00:44,960
If I didn't save him

4
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:47,479
I couldn't just watch Ah Hong get hurt

5
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,719
I know you're worried about me

6
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:50,240
Come on, don't be angry

7
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,079
I'm not afraid of you going back to fight.

8
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:52,960
I'm afraid...

9
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,119
I'm afraid you'll end up like my mom

10
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,560
When I was seven years old,

11
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:11,519
there was a doll I really loved.

12
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:14,439
I begged my mom for it forever.

13
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:17,239
Finally, she agreed to buy it for me.

14
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,280
I was so happy that day.

15
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,599
But just as we neared the store,

16
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,359
we ran into Gangsters robbing people.

17
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,280
They just swung their knives,

18
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,719
all for a measly few hundred bucks.

19
00:01:33,719 --> 00:01:35,959
They stabbed her again and again.

20
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,599
Mom...

21
00:01:41,719 --> 00:01:43,359
My mom never even made it to the hospital.

22
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:44,519
She was gone.

23
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,920
So I've hated the mob since I was a kid.

24
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,959
To me, they're nothing but a pack

25
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,439
of soulless animals.

26
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,000
They kill people,

27
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,159
and still strut around the streets.

28
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,840
If one day they end up dead in a gutter,

29
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,120
they'd have it coming.

30
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,560
But did you know,

31
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,080
on my way here to find you just now,

32
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,360
I was so afraid that when I got here,

33
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,840
I'd see you lying dead on the roadside.

34
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,680
Do you have any idea...

35
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,879
I was scared I'd never see you again.

36
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,759
Will you walk around the school with me?

37
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:10,599
Teacher Danni!

38
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,360
School's out!

39
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,400
School's out!

40
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:14,000
Go study hard, there's a quiz tomorrow!

41
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:15,240
Okay, I got it!

42
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:20,319
As a kid, my dream was to be a cop.

43
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,759
I wanted to put every gang in Harbor City

44
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,879
behind bars.

45
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,919
So I studied like my life depended on it.

46
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,280
My grades were always excellent.

47
00:03:30,599 --> 00:03:32,759
I made it into the police academy prelims.

48
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:34,599
But sadly,

49
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,439
I wasn't in very good shape as a kid.

50
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:39,240
During training,

51
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,280
I'd pass out after just three laps.

52
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,840
So you chose to study teaching instead,

53
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,879
to teach those students

54
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,639
not to become the people you hate most.

55
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,120
Yes.

56
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,319
Except, when I first got here,

57
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:57,080
I didn't believe I could change anything either.

58
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,879
Because the kids here

59
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:02,479
skip class, smoke, fight, and steal.

60
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,080
No different from street punks.

61
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,039
Sis Danni!

62
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,520
What's with the "Sis"? Call me Teacher.

63
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:11,960
You don't have class today.

64
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,919
Why are you here?

65
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,560
You and your big mouth.

66
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,479
Get back home already.

67
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,319
Your boyfriend?

68
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:22,439
If you don't leave now, you'll miss the bus.

69
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,279
But later I realized

70
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,160
they weren't born bad.

71
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:35,680
Some have family members who do drugs.

72
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,279
Some have parents addicted to gambling.

73
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,480
And some have no home at all.

74
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,680
These kids,

75
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:44,879
they were just thrown into this river.

76
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,839
Because they can't swim,

77
00:04:47,839 --> 00:04:49,079
and no one reaches out to pull them up,

78
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,439
all they can do is drift with the current.

79
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,639
Or even

80
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,000
drown in that river.

81
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,519
I don't expect

82
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:01,160
these kids will top the exams.

83
00:05:01,879 --> 00:05:02,800
I just hope

84
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:05,160
they can learn a trade,

85
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:08,839
so they can live clean lives someday.

86
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,720
That night you said

87
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,000
if you weren't a Gangster, you'd starve.

88
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:21,040
That's when I understood.

89
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,839
You're one of these kids too.

90
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,160
I'll be right by your side to help you live a good life.

91
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,360
Zihao

92
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,600
Zihao

93
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:13,879
You okay?

94
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:22,120
Why so quiet after seeing the cops?

95
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,399
Did they scare you?

96
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,120
Did you tell them?

97
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,720
No.

98
00:07:31,879 --> 00:07:32,560
No, I didn't.

99
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,480
They questioned me,

100
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,519
and I said I knew nothing.

101
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:42,920
See?

102
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:44,959
That's just how this business is.

103
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,920
There's always someone giving you trouble.

104
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,160
It never ends.

105
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,480
Why aren't you eating?

106
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,519
This used to be your favorite.

107
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:25,639
Your mom and I used to shield you.

108
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:28,000
We didn't want you getting too involved.

109
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,040
But now you know.

110
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:34,720
Everything you see is just on the surface.

111
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,519
Those people who call you Young Master,

112
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,559
who drink with you,

113
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,879
who joke and hang around with you,

114
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,720
they only do it for my sake.

115
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:55,679
Everyone in this world is an actor.

116
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,799
Everyone is putting on an act.

117
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:02,879
Don't get too caught up in it.

118
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,639
That night you insisted on coming along.

119
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,720
It was your fate to see it.

120
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,600
I'm sorry.

121
00:09:17,279 --> 00:09:18,720
I didn't mean to.

122
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,799
I really didn't mean to.

123
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,039
Don't blame me.

124
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,480
Your mom always opposed you doing this.

125
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,080
I understand.

126
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,840
But your last name is Xie.

127
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,639
You have to walk this path eventually.

128
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:45,720
You have to remember:

129
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,720
In this world,

130
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:51,399
it's kill or be killed.

131
00:10:11,559 --> 00:10:13,399
Based on the evidence gathered at the scene,

132
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:15,159
Xie Guanhong

133
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,279
isn't just

134
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,720
a key suspect in Camel's death.

135
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:22,879
He allegedly drove Cannon to suicide too.

136
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,039
A few weeks ago,

137
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:31,000
a vicious murder happened on the mainland,

138
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:32,759
involving an eight-year-old child.

139
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,360
We immediately

140
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:45,120
took the suspect into custody.

141
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,440
After investigating,

142
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,480
we suspect this case

143
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,399
involves a contract killing.

144
00:10:53,879 --> 00:10:55,960
Someone else must be pulling the strings.

145
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:58,840
Cannon killed himself

146
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,840
because Xie Guanhong used his family against him.

147
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,360
You suspect Xie Guanhong?

148
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,679
This bad root must be completely cut off.

149
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,240
Cut it all off.

150
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:17,720
Otherwise it'll...

151
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,279
Why?

152
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:20,799
It'll affect the other leaves.

153
00:11:22,039 --> 00:11:24,159
And it'll soak up all the nutrients.

154
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:25,960
What about this one? Should I cut it?

155
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,039
Hello. What flowers would you like?

156
00:11:31,399 --> 00:11:32,600
He's not here to buy flowers.

157
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,399
Brother Qiang.

158
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,559
You two talk, then.

159
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:39,399
I'll go cook.

160
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:44,360
What are you doing here?

161
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,200
I just went to see Uncle Fat.

162
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:49,960
He's the one who sent me to you.

163
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:52,879
Everyone knows what kind of man you are.

164
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,480
If you weren't Xie Guanhong's brother,

165
00:11:56,879 --> 00:11:58,279
we'd have followed you long ago.

166
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:01,240
If you've seen Uncle Fat,

167
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,159
you should know

168
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,759
I've made my position very clear.

169
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,759
But Brother Qiang...

170
00:12:05,759 --> 00:12:06,600
No buts.

171
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:08,320
I know you're loyal to a fault.

172
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,720
And you want to avenge Brother Pao.

173
00:12:10,679 --> 00:12:11,879
But Ah Hong told me

174
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:13,320
he didn't kill Brother Pao.

175
00:12:13,679 --> 00:12:14,639
Brother Qiang, don't tell me

176
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:16,000
you still trust Xie Guanhong.

177
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:17,320
He's no longer

178
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,519
the man you once knew.

179
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:26,159
I suggest you leave this to the police.

180
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,799
Go to the cops?

181
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,360
Guys like us in this life,

182
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:34,159
no matter how big the grudge,

183
00:12:34,159 --> 00:12:35,600
we settle it ourselves.

184
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,320
Go to the cops?

185
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,279
You might as well tell me to die.

186
00:12:43,799 --> 00:12:46,279
Brother Qiang, I must avenge Brother Pao!

187
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,720
I suggest you stop breaking the law.

188
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:56,360
I know.

189
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,399
You're all about loyalty, of course.

190
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:01,159
But Xie Guanhong deceived you.

191
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,519
You know he didn't just kill Brother Pao?

192
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,519
He also killed Brother Pao's wife and kid.

193
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:14,919
See for yourself.

194
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:32,639
We both know: Don't touch the family.

195
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,840
Xie Guanhong crossed the line long ago.

196
00:13:37,759 --> 00:13:39,480
He'd just tell you what you want to hear.

197
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,519
Because whatever he says,

198
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:42,519
even if it's a lie,

199
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,200
you'll believe him anyway!

200
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,200
Brother Qiang,

201
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,759
just think about it.

202
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,039
This Xie Guanhong,

203
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:48,720
is he still

204
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,080
the man you knew back then?

205
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,360
Let me tell you,

206
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:52,879
I didn't do it.

207
00:13:53,639 --> 00:13:55,360
Are you still the old Ah Hong?

208
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,080
I didn't kill Cannon. Do you believe me?

209
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,559
You trust the cops, you trust Cannon,

210
00:13:59,559 --> 00:14:00,799
but you just won't trust me.

211
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,120
Just because of the word "rules,"

212
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:03,759
I have to give up

213
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:05,240
everything from all these years and leave?

214
00:14:07,559 --> 00:14:08,440
Teacher!

215
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,360
Teacher Danni!

216
00:14:09,639 --> 00:14:10,840
Teacher Danni, something's wrong!

217
00:14:10,879 --> 00:14:12,559
Xiao Qi's going to sell his kidney!

218
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:13,799
What?
